{
  "id": "447001",
  "resourceId": 470,
  "name": "小紅帽",
  "skin": "荒誕紅",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c470_01_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c470_01_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "在幹嘛？\n沒事做的話，要不要聽歌？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "唉～真的很不舒服。\n不該穿禮服來的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "哇～天氣真好！\n這種日子應該要在外面聽音樂，\n要不要一起去？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "別說我像大叔，\n乾脆說我像大哥怎麼樣？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "我沒來過這種場合，有點尷尬，\n不過……其實我還蠻喜歡的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "啊～現在要是能喝杯啤酒一定很棒。\n有沒有人要陪我一起去喝？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "你要是沒事的話，就過來替我按按肩膀。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "派對怎麼會放這種歌啊？\n啊啊……耳朵要聾了。能不能換首歌啊？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "其他人都在做些什麼呢？\n嗯～來聯絡看看好了？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "很多東西都是越老越好的。\n希望你也能有件這樣的東西。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "大家都放開一點，快來喝一杯。\n今天是好日子哦～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "哇……真的好平靜。\n哈哈，平靜？\n沒想到我會有說這種話的一天。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "有常聽的歌就告訴我，\n我也要聽聽看。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "嗨，美女～等等要不要跟我跳支舞？\n哈哈哈！開玩笑啦～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "能像這樣和帥哥一起共度時光，真不錯。\n這絕對會是難忘的一天。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "你要活得久一點，\n因為活著就是好事。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "快過來！這邊放的是老歌！\n派對還是放這種歌最適合～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "帥哥，怎麼樣？\n我們現在\n算是相識有點久的關係了嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "慢慢忙你的事吧，我先聽歌。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "有沒有什麼好玩的？\n人呢？都去哪了啊？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "呃～一個人待著好無聊。\n既然這麼無聊，\n要不要去捉弄帥哥呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "我並不討厭一個人獨處，\n但我也不喜歡一個人待太久。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～紅酒味道不錯！\n待會帶白雪也喝喝看。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "帥哥，慢走。\n我會邊聽歌邊享受這難得的好日子。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "我喜歡這個劇院。\n音響效果肯定很好吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "哇～居然還有這種地方？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～這裡很適合白天喝酒……\n哈哈哈，被聽到了嗎？帥哥要不要一起喝？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "我不太適應這種太發達的地方，\n讓人有點喘不過氣。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "沒想到東西蠻齊全的嘛！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "這裡真是個宜居的地方。\n好到我想把所有人都帶來這裡生活。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "勝利女神，還有勝利之翼啊……\n哈哈，我很欣慰。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "一看就知道這是個很宜居的地方。\n管理得很棒。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～好像參觀得差不多了，\n這次要不要去看看帥哥的房間？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "我是過去的人，很快就會離開的。\n但是，我在的這段時間會盡全力幫助你的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "選擇派對服裝時，禮服絕對是首選。\n怎麼樣，好看嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "帥哥～我又來麻煩你啦。\n既然這樣，要不要一起聽首音樂？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "噢噢……！厲害啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼覺得身體好像變輕了？\n……是因為衣服變薄了嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "哦，真不錯耶。感覺身體變得好輕盈。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "哇～在我的時代，這些連想像都想像不到。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼覺得身體有點癢呢？\n看來待會該去欺負一下白雪了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "這都是什麼時候弄來的？謝謝你，帥哥～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "最近大家都是這樣變強的嗎？真方便啊～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "噢？我覺得我現在有實力能打敗莉莉絲……\n欸我什、什麼都沒說！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "好，那要從什麼開始？儘管說，我都會幫你實現。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "噢～什麼情況？你送我這個是對我有什麼企圖嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "啊？你是我的粉絲嗎？\n謝謝你的禮物～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "唉唷，你又在撩人啦～\n哈哈，謝謝你。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "送禮就該禮尚往來，你有什麼需要的嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "一直這樣收禮物，我會養成壞習慣的！\n下不為例，好嗎～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "帥哥有什麼想要的東西嗎？下次我買給你。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "沒有什麼黃色書刊嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "看來女神部隊真的很受歡迎。\n連我都收到禮物了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "這些真的都要給我？那你自己還有剩嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "你這傢伙不錯，以後也要繼續保持啊。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "什麼？禮服比較適合我？\n我決定了！以後天天都穿這個～！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "帥哥你啊，怎麼看都是個好人耶。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "哎，我要是再年輕一點，你就不妙了喔。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "是酒的後勁上來了嗎？我的臉好紅。",
      "animation": "panic"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，居然會跟你變得這麼要好。\n唉……這樣我會捨不得啊。",
      "animation": "panic"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "過來，我們一起聽歌。一人一隻耳機吧。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "這是我最喜歡的歌。\n一起聽，感覺更好了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "如果是你，應該可以託付我寶貴的東西。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "小紅帽！出戰！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "什麼啊，要我這樣走？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "休息也休息夠了，那就走吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，你說。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "前進，前進！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "救命！裙子一直纏住腳！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "好，我們走！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "準備好了？那就上吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "這邊是新的派對場地嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，這些傢伙來了啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "你們這些傢伙，都給我滾開！我忙得很！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "沒想到還會有穿禮服戰鬥的一天。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "久違地來認真打一場吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "放心交給我吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "舞伴太多了吧～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
